chunk:
The ten categories of open space subdistricts established in Section 3-1 are:

                  (a)

                  OS-G, Community Garden;

                  (b)

                  OS-P, Parkland;

                  (c)

                  OS-RC, Recreation;

                  (d)

                  OS-UW, Urban Wild;

                  (e)

                  OS-SL, Shoreland;

                  (f)

                  OS-WA, Waterfront Access Area;

                  (g)

                  OS-CM, Cemetery;

                  (h)

                  OS-UP, Urban Plaza;

                  (i)

                  OS-S, Stadium;

                  (j)

                  OS-A, Air-Right. (Text Amd.
